{"channelId":"UCXU7oIDCSbruxEC5rxkjbrw","row":["Fur Warriors",323,"Fur Warriors is a charity organization that helps to rescue, rehabilitate, and find forever homes for survivors of the dog meat trade, high kill shelters, and animal abuse cases world wide.   \n\nWe work hard to rescue local stray cats, rehabilitate, and specialize in socializing feral cats to be loving house pets to keep them safe off the streets forever.   \n\nAll our animals are rescued, sterilized, vaccinated and rehabilitated to be loving family pets.  We also do feeding, sterilization & vaccination programs to stray animals outside of our rescue.  \n\nOur rescue is as strong as our community support behind us. We rely on donations and community fundraisers to help hundreds of animals in need. \n\nOur rescue is 100% volunteered based with dedicated individuals who have an extreme love and passion for animals. We are not paid,  but passionate about being a voice for the voiceless. \n\n. \n\nTo contribute towards our mission, donations can be made via \nWWW.FURWARRIORS.COM/DONATE","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXU7oIDCSbruxEC5rxkjbrw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXU7oIDCSbruxEC5rxkjbrw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:40.261Z","channelId":"UCXU7oIDCSbruxEC5rxkjbrw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"5019a0f2ca66e14c0cc25fd673c1ba3892697e19bd4d489c85969019306bf474","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"08e197f0d397904b1e6b7a70c609f6366c46f36f9bafcec017d6ad086343c896"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXU7oIDCSbruxEC5rxkjbrw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":323,"raw":"323 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXU7oIDCSbruxEC5rxkjbrw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:40.261Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue"